Objective 2,GAMIFICATION,Power-ups purchasable with KKCoin,Mobile,OK,,2026-08-24,Alyssa,"Reveal 5 KK and Bomb 10 KK both allowed per dish with a 1-minute cooldown between them. Instant Solve is live at 50 KK so it stays rare. XP/points never buy help. POST reward/spend.php prices are server-fixed."
Objective 3,BLOCKCHAIN INCENTIVE,Phase 1: event trigger + AES-256 encrypt + SHA-256 hash,Backend / Chain,OK,,2026-08-20,Alyssa,"Live on XAMPP 2026-08-20: POST /kusinakode/REST/reward/trigger.php returned phase=1 status=pending payload_hash (64 hex) signature=null tx_hash=null. AES-256-GCM then SHA-256 of ciphertext. Pipeline is in api/lib/ + reward/. 12 Phase 1 unit tests PASS."
Objective 3,BLOCKCHAIN INCENTIVE,Phase 2: transaction assembly + ECDSA sign + PoA validation,Backend / Chain,OK,,2026-08-20,Alyssa,"Private Polygon-compatible sidechain with Proof-of-Authority (not public mainnet). Live 2026-08-20: GET reward/status.php advanced tx_ref kk_afa18649… to phase=2 pending with ECDSA signature. Implemented as local PHP PoA on XAMPP — not a public Polygon node yet. PoA unit tests PASS."
Objective 3,BLOCKCHAIN INCENTIVE,Phase 3: block append + chain sync,Backend / Chain,OK,,2026-08-20,Alyssa,"Tamper-evident linking across validator nodes. Live 2026-08-20: same tx_ref advanced to phase=3 pending with block_ref 8a09a18d…. One local chain (api/chain/data) on XAMPP, not multiple Azure validator VMs (Kyla). Chain append + genesis sync unit tests PASS."
Objective 3,BLOCKCHAIN INCENTIVE,Phase 4: smart contract execution + TxHash receipt,Backend / Chain,OK,,2026-08-20,Alyssa,"Smart contract must transfer tokens / mint badge and return a TxHash. Live 2026-08-21: round_win tx_hash 0xe163f183… amount_kk=10. Live 2026-08-24: badge_milestone tx_ref kk_f5236886… phase=4 confirmed tx_hash 0xae5021b2… amount_kk=25; badges.tx_hash pointer set. Azure node is Kyla."
Objective 3,BLOCKCHAIN INCENTIVE,Reward token contract (ERC-20-style),Backend / Chain,OK,,2026-08-21,Alyssa,"Design choice, not a literal manuscript requirement — confirm with adviser. KKCoin.sol validator-only mintFromPool. Live 2026-08-21: balance_kk=10; live 2026-08-24 after badge mint balance_kk=35 at 0xcb2e9f…. Hardhat not run (no Node on this Mac)."
Objective 3,BLOCKCHAIN INCENTIVE,Badge/achievement contract (ERC-721-style),Backend / Chain,OK,,2026-08-24,Alyssa,"Same design-decision caveat as the token contract. Live 2026-08-24: POST post_badge.php badge_id live-mint-20260824 then status polls reached phase=4 tx_hash 0xae5021b2…. Duplicate POST returned awarded=false tx_ref=null. Chain state has one mint at 0xcb2e9f…|live-mint-20260824. Hardhat not run."
Objective 3,BLOCKCHAIN INCENTIVE,Custodial wallet management (Key Vault-backed),Backend / Chain,OK,,2026-08-24,Alyssa,"Players never see seed phrases or gas fees. users.wallet_address is a pointer only. Local vault/data seam works. Live 2026-08-24: GET wallet/balance.php returned address 0xcb2e9f… balance_kk=35 is_live=true. phpMyAdmin: browse users_readable / badges_readable / reward_claims_readable / shop_unlocks_readable (migration 008) — original tables stay API-shaped. Azure Key Vault provisioning is Kyla."
Objective 3,BLOCKCHAIN INCENTIVE,POST /api/reward/trigger.php,Backend / Chain,OK,,2026-08-20,Alyssa,"Fires after a verified game/badge event; returns tx_ref with status=pending. Live 2026-08-20: POST does Phase 1 only so Phases 2-4 stay separable (they advance on GET status.php)."
Objective 3,BLOCKCHAIN INCENTIVE,GET /api/reward/status.php,Backend / Chain,OK,,2026-08-20,Alyssa,"Poll status of a pending reward transaction. Live 2026-08-20/21: same tx_ref walked phase 2 then 3 then 4 to confirmed."
Objective 3,BLOCKCHAIN INCENTIVE,GET /api/wallet/balance.php,Backend / Chain,OK,,2026-08-21,Alyssa,"Read-only token balance for the custodial wallet. Live 2026-08-21: balance_kk=10. Live 2026-08-24 after badge mint: balance_kk=35 at 0xcb2e9f… is_live=true. No keys in the response."
Objective 3,BLOCKCHAIN INCENTIVE,GET /api/audit/log.php and GET /api/audit/tx.php,Backend / Chain,OK,,2026-08-24,Alyssa,"Required by the admin audit panel. Live 2026-08-24: player token got 403; admin GET audit/log.php returned the badge_milestone receipt; GET audit/tx.php?hash=0xae5021b2… returned the same row. Yow dashboard UI is a separate Not Started row."
Objective 3,BLOCKCHAIN INCENTIVE,"Mobile wallet and reward UI (balance, verifying → verified, TxHash)",Mobile,OK,,2026-08-24,Alyssa,"Player-facing display only. +10 KK per new dish (replay +0). Badge +25 is claimed on Rewards. Shops: Kusina Reel, KODEX Pantry, Chef's Atelier portrait frames. Recent History lists the caller's TxHash receipts from GET reward/history.php."
